flowchart LR
    WPF[WPF Desktop App] --> Services[Application Services]
    Services --> DbContext[EF Core AppDbContext]
    DbContext --> SQL[(SQL Server)]
    Services --> Excel[ClosedXML Excel import/export]
    Services --> CSV[CSV import]
    WPF --> Print[Windows PrintDialog]
    WPF --> Dialog[Open/Save File Dialog]
